   "subject": "Geomorph PCA problem",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Good evening! <div><br></div><div>Does anyone have experience with the package geomorph? I have a geometric morphometric dataset I am using for species delimitation (for legionary vampire ants), but I cannot do PCA with my array. I can paste the error print out here if necessary. The problem is that for PCA, geomorph needs a 3D array, my data are indeed in a 3D array, but gpagen() returns an error that the data are not arranged in 3D. Any help or guidance is appreciated! (I&#39;ve been excited about this dataset for a while!)<div><br></div><div>Thank you in advance,</div><div>Brendon</div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
