     "<div dir=\"auto\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467684476000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jllgdQ3o2B1zNoxh8YpUZ\">http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467684476000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Z6ta8MeFVBsrSaHuEYoPy\">http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467684476000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lJZWEwmRFK8Utn-LiQEzZ\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div>"
